\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Dose-response: CAR vs.\ OCC gradient flow duration (v1 codebase, all conditions). Filled circles: early-cutoff conditions with all 3 seeds completed; open circles: conditions with $\leq $2 seeds (counts annotated as $n$). Diamond ($\diamond $): Reverse Cutoff (gradient flow restricted to the last 15K steps). Dashed line: Vanilla 3-seed mean (v1); shaded band: $\pm \,$1\,SE. The ``+0.2\%'' annotation marks the Cutoff@15K--Vanilla gap. Intermediate cutoff conditions cluster near Vanilla, while Cutoff@25K and Reverse Cutoff fall substantially below.}}{16}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dose_response}{{5}{16}{Dose-response: CAR vs.\ OCC gradient flow duration (v1 codebase, all conditions). Filled circles: early-cutoff conditions with all 3 seeds completed; open circles: conditions with $\leq $2 seeds (counts annotated as $n$). Diamond ($\diamond $): Reverse Cutoff (gradient flow restricted to the last 15K steps). Dashed line: Vanilla 3-seed mean (v1); shaded band: $\pm \,$1\,SE. The ``+0.2\%'' annotation marks the Cutoff@15K--Vanilla gap. Intermediate cutoff conditions cluster near Vanilla, while Cutoff@25K and Reverse Cutoff fall substantially below}{figure.caption.12}{}}
